==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|strāle}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|strāla}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*strēlaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*strēlō||arrow, ray, beam}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*strēl-}} {{m|ine-pro|*strēlā-||arrow, beam}}. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|straal}}, English {{m|en|streal}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃtʁaːl/|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|aːl|lang=de}}

